# Runtime patches target LF files unpacked from npm on every operating system.
*.patch text eol=lf
# Unified diff context adds a space before the original tab indentation.
# A context-only blank line is a single space, including at the end of a patch.
# These are unified diff syntax; ordinary source files retain all whitespace checks.
*.patch whitespace=-space-before-tab,-blank-at-eol,-blank-at-eof
